            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Sagebane"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(necromancy, occult)\n\nWhen the kurobozu damages a living creature with an unarmed Strike, the target must succeed at a 24 Fortitude save or become stupefied 1 for 1 minute. Further damage dealt by the kurobozu resets the duration to 1 minute and increases the stupefied value by 1 on a failed save, to a maximum of stupefied 4."
